{
    "name": "pafish/pafish-php",
    "description": "pafish 博客 CMS PHP 版 —— 轻量零构建，支持共享虚拟主机，一键 Web 安装",
    "type": "project",
    "license": "MIT",
    "version": "0.1.22",
    "require": {
        "php": ">=8.1",
        "slim/slim": "^4.14",
        "slim/psr7": "^1.7",
        "php-di/php-di": "^7.0"
    },
    "autoload": {
        "psr-4": {
            "Pafish\\": "app/"
        },
        "files": [
            "app/Lib/Parsedown.php",
            "app/Lib/ParsedownExtra.php"
        ]
    },
    "config": {
        "optimize-autoloader": true,
        "sort-packages": true,
        "preferred-install": "dist",
        "policy": {
            "advisories": {
                "ignore-id": [
                    "GHSA-53h4-8rc4-f539"
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    "_comment": "GHSA-53h4-8rc4-f539（CVE-2026-48157）：Slim HtmlErrorRenderer 反射型 XSS，影响 ≤4.15.1，官方暂无修复版本。pafish 生产使用自研错误页（不渲染异常详情/不输出用户输入），不经过 HtmlErrorRenderer，风险可控；官方补丁发布后移除本忽略并升级。"
}
